---
version: 2.0.2
title: schema help dialog
---
<dialog aria-labelledby="schema-help-title" class="ui-dialog" closedby="any" id="schema-help"><header class="ui-dialog__header"><h2 class="ui-dialog__title" id="schema-help-title">CV schema</h2><form method="dialog"><button class="ui-button ui-button--secondary">Close</button></form></header><div class="ui-dialog__body"><p>A CV is one YAML document. Keys not listed here are errors. Text values may be strings or numbers and must not be empty. Problems are listed below the editor while you type.</p><h3>Document</h3><p>The top level of the document.</p><table class="ui-field-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Key</th><th scope="col">Required</th><th scope="col">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">schema_version</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">required</td><td>Schema version. Must be <code>1</code>.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">style</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">optional</td><td>Visual settings; see <code>style</code>.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">person</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">required</td><td>Who the CV is about; see <code>person</code>.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">contact</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">optional</td><td>Contact details; see <code>contact</code>.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">sections</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">required</td><td>The sections in the order they appear; see <code>sections[]</code>. May be empty: <code>[]</code>.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>style</h3><p>How the CV looks. Every key has a default.</p><table class="ui-field-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Key</th><th scope="col">Required</th><th scope="col">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">theme</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">optional</td><td>Layout and typography. One of: <code>classic</code>, <code>minimal</code>, <code>studio</code>, <code>spotlight</code>. Default: <code>classic</code>.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">color</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">optional</td><td>Accent colour. One of: <code>black</code>, <code>blue</code>, <code>burgundy</code>, <code>green</code>, <code>grey</code>, <code>orange</code>, <code>purple</code>, <code>red</code>. Default: <code>blue</code>.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">paper</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">optional</td><td>Paper size. One of: <code>a4</code>, <code>letter</code>. Default: <code>a4</code>.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">photo_shape</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">optional</td><td>Crop of the profile photo. One of: <code>rectangle</code>, <code>rounded</code>, <code>circle</code>. Default: <code>rectangle</code>.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>person</h3><p>Shown at the top of the CV.</p><table class="ui-field-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Key</th><th scope="col">Required</th><th scope="col">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">name</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">required</td><td>Full name, shown as the heading.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">title</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">optional</td><td>Job title or tagline under the name.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">address</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">optional</td><td>Postal address.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">photo</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">optional</td><td>Profile photo, shown next to the name: a JPEG or PNG of at most 512 KiB and 4000 × 4000 pixels as a data URI, <code>data:image/jpeg;base64,…</code>. The editor&#39;s photo button creates it. The photo is not stored by the service.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>contact</h3><p>How to reach you. Every key is optional.</p><table class="ui-field-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Key</th><th scope="col">Required</th><th scope="col">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">email</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">optional</td><td>Email address.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">phone</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">optional</td><td>Phone number.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">website</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">optional</td><td>Website address.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">links</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">optional</td><td>Further links; see <code>contact.links[]</code>.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>contact.links[]</h3><p>Each item of the links list.</p><table class="ui-field-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Key</th><th scope="col">Required</th><th scope="col">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">label</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">required</td><td>Text shown, for example <code>GitHub</code>.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">url</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">required</td><td>Address the link points to.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>sections[]</h3><p>Each section has a name and a kind; the kind decides which key holds its content.</p><table class="ui-field-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Key</th><th scope="col">Required</th><th scope="col">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">name</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">required</td><td>Section heading.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">kind</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">optional</td><td>What the section contains. One of: <code>entries</code>, <code>skills</code>, <code>text</code>. Default: <code>entries</code>.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">entries</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">if kind is entries</td><td>List of dated items; see <code>sections[].entries[]</code>.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">items</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">if kind is skills</td><td>List of skills or languages; see <code>sections[].items[]</code>.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">text</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">if kind is text</td><td>A paragraph of free text.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>sections[].entries[]</h3><p>A dated item such as a job or a degree.</p><table class="ui-field-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Key</th><th scope="col">Required</th><th scope="col">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">timespan</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">required</td><td>Period as text, for example <code>2019 – 2023</code> or <code>since 2020</code>.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">title</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">required</td><td>Role, degree or similar.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">organization</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">optional</td><td>Employer, school or similar.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">location</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">optional</td><td>City or place.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">bullets</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">optional</td><td>List of text lines shown as bullet points.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>sections[].items[]</h3><p>A skill or language.</p><table class="ui-field-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Key</th><th scope="col">Required</th><th scope="col">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">name</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">required</td><td>Name of the skill or language.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="ui-field-table__key">level</code></th><td class="ui-field-table__requirement">optional</td><td>Level as text, for example <code>Fluent</code>.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></dialog>
